  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Coordination Expert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general context in Afghanistan with regard to MHPSS stays sensitive. In March, the technical working group (TWG) coordinator left. Unfortunately, until now, no suitable candidate has been identified to take over. Therefore, there is an urgent need to reinforce the management of the MHPSS TWG. This is where the request comes from. The assignment will allow the continuation of the activities as defined in the Workplan, and will support the management of current challenges faced by the MHPSS TWG members. It will also build on previous DSS Support.</narrative>
  </description>
